  "plan": {
    "goal": "Co-incubate UGT1A1 with testosterone at 3329.5 µM in the presence of a competitive inhibitor (Ki 214.2 µM) at 395.8 µM and quantify the inhibited velocity and percent inhibition.",
    "rationale": "Competitive inhibition of UGT1A1-catalyzed testosterone glucuronidation. Substrate [S]=3329.5 µM at Km=1978.4 µM; competitive inhibitor [I]=395.8 µM with Ki=214.2 µM; Vmax=1.5883 µmol/min. Fractional activity under competitive inhibition is [S]/(Km(1+[I]/Ki)+[S]); run-condition IC50 follows Cheng-Prusoff Ki(1+[S]/Km); inhibited velocity = fractional activity × Vmax; percent inhibition = (1 − fractional activity)×100. All derived values are computed by the calculators.",
